   "gap_per_mtok_out_spread": 1.2402,
   "gap_per_call_spread": 3.954,
   "gap_per_mtok_in_spread": 9.1088,
   "reading": "the missing dollars are proportional to OUTPUT TOKENS (per-window spread 1.2402x) and not to calls (3.954x) or input tokens (9.1088x). Missing ledger rows lose whole calls, so an incomplete ledger would show its gap constant per CALL; it is 3.2x looser there than per output token. The incomplete-ledger story would additionally have to claim that 72.3% of a 12-day window's real money and 44.8% of a supervised 25-minute window's real money left no trace, at unledgered burn rates 160x apart."
  },
